                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 2:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Click on Beneficiary Registration. A new page will appears. Select \"New beneficiary registration\" if you are registering for the first time."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 3:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Register by entering your Ration Card Number and Mobile Number, then click GET OTP."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 4: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Enter the One Time Password (OTP) received on your mobile number and click Register."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 5: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Upon successful registration, a Success pop-up will appear."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 6:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Select your Applicant Type from the available options: Livestock Keeper, Farmer and Livestock Keeper, or Student/Trainee. Click Save."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 7: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Fill in the General Details, Personal Details, Bank Details, as required, and click the Proceed button. Confirm by clicking OK on the pop-up."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 8:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Upload the required documents by clicking Choose File and then Upload File."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 9: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "After uploading all documents, a window will appear. Click View to check each document. If any document was uploaded incorrectly, click Delete and re-upload it."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 10:"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " Once all documents are verified, click the Proceed button. Confirm by clicking OK on the pop-up."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Step 11: "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "After completing these steps, your profile will be created, and the portal dashboard will be displayed."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
