          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicant should be a woman. \n1. The applicant should belong to Scheduled Tribes (ST).\n1. The applicant should belong to a Below Poverty Line (BPL) family.\n1. The applicant should be a farmer, livestock keeper (Pashu Palak), or self-employed woman in tribal or forest areas.\n1. The applicant should be interested in self-employment through dairy farming.\n\n<br>\n\n"
